Project Planning Phase
EduGenie: Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

Project Planning Phase

1. Introduction

EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant designed to help students learn subjects easily and effectively. It uses Google Gemini to provide personalized explanations, answer questions, summarize study materials, generate quizzes, and assist students with their academic work.

The Project Planning Phase focuses on deciding what needs to be developed, how it will be developed, who will work on each task, and when each task will be completed.


---

2. Project Objectives

The main objectives of EduGenie are:

To provide an AI-based personal learning assistant.

To answer students' questions quickly and clearly.

To explain difficult topics in simple language.

To generate summaries and notes from study materials.

To create practice questions and quizzes.

To provide personalized learning support based on the student's needs.

To reduce the time required to search for educational information.

To make learning more interactive and accessible.



---

3. Project Scope

The EduGenie project will include the following features:

Module	Description

User Interface	Simple interface for students to interact with EduGenie
AI Chat Assistant	Answers academic questions using Gemini
Topic Explanation	Explains difficult concepts in simple terms
Summarization	Converts lengthy study materials into short notes
Quiz Generator	Creates questions for practice
Study Assistance	Helps students prepare for examinations
Personalized Learning	Provides responses according to the student's learning needs
Feedback	Allows users to provide feedback about the system



---

4. Technology Planning

The proposed technologies are:

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Backend: Python

AI Model: Google Gemini API

Database: MySQL / SQLite

Development Environment: Visual Studio Code

Version Control: Git and GitHub

API: Gemini API



---

5. Project Team Planning

Team Member/Role	Responsibility

