10. Expected Outcome

At the end of the project, EduGenie is expected to provide a simple, intelligent, and interactive learning platform where students can ask questions, understand difficult concepts, generate summaries and quizzes, and receive AI-based academic assistance.

11. Conclusion

The Project Planning Phase establishes a clear roadmap for developing EduGenie. By defining the objectives, scope, technologies, team responsibilities, schedule, resources, and risks, the development process can be carried out in an organized and systematic manner. EduGenie aims to make learning simpler, faster, personalized, and more engaging for students.
